---
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CitationCard from '../../components/CitationCard.astro';
---
<article class="page-panel citation-page">
  <PageHeader class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Oral History Citation</p>
    <h1>Shannon Morgan Oral History</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      Citation information for the oral-history interview with
      Shannon Morgan, conducted by Carrie Gabaree (Gutierrez)

      at McCormick Research Center, First Division Museum at Cantigny, Wheaton, Illinois on April 1, 2009.
    </p>
  </PageHeader>

  <section class="citation-summary">
    <p class="publication-meta">
      Oral history · CORHC-0004 · April 1, 2009 · Runtime: 27:44
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Interviewee:</strong> Shannon Morgan<br />
      <strong>Interviewer:</strong> Carrie Gabaree (Gutierrez)<br />
      <strong>Repository:</strong> Carrie Gabaree Digital Archive
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="citation-list">

    <CitationCard class="citation-card">
      <div class="citation-card-header">
        <h2>Chicago</h2>
        <button class="citation-copy"
                type="button"
                data-copy-target="corhc-0004-chicago"> Copy citation </button>
      </div>
      <p id="corhc-0004-chicago" class="citation-text">
        Morgan, Shannon. Interview by Carrie Gabaree (Gutierrez). April 1, 2009. CORHC-0004, Carrie Gabaree Digital Archive. https://carriegabaree.com/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0004-shannon-morgan.html.
      </p>
    </CitationCard>

    <CitationCard class="citation-card">
      <div class="citation-card-header">
        <h2>MLA</h2>
        <button class="citation-copy"
                type="button"
                data-copy-target="corhc-0004-mla"> Copy citation </button>
      </div>
      <p id="corhc-0004-mla" class="citation-text">
        Morgan, Shannon. Interview by Carrie Gabaree (Gutierrez). <cite>Carrie Gabaree Digital Archive</cite>, April 1, 2009, https://carriegabaree.com/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0004-shannon-morgan.html.
      </p>
    </CitationCard>

    <CitationCard class="citation-card">
      <div class="citation-card-header">
        <h2>APA</h2>
        <button class="citation-copy"
                type="button"
                data-copy-target="corhc-0004-apa"> Copy citation </button>
      </div>
      <p id="corhc-0004-apa" class="citation-text">
        Morgan, S. (2009, April 1). <cite>Shannon Morgan Oral History</cite> [Oral history interview by Carrie Gabaree (Gutierrez)]. Carrie Gabaree Digital Archive. https://carriegabaree.com/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0004-shannon-morgan.html
      </p>
    </CitationCard>

  </div>

  <aside class="citation-note">
    <h2>Oral-history citation note</h2>
    <p>
      Oral-history citation practices vary by style guide and institution.
      These citations identify the interviewee or interviewees, interviewer,
      interview date, archival identifier, repository, and stable interview
      page so researchers can locate the audiovisual recording and transcript.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <div class="button-group citation-actions">
    <a class="button button-primary" href="/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0004-shannon-morgan">
      View oral history
    </a>
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0004-shannon-morgan-transcript">
      Read transcript
    </a>
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="/oral-histories">
      Back to oral histories
    </a>
  </div>

  <p class="citation-disclaimer">
    Citations are provided for convenience. Requirements may vary by
    institution, publisher, instructor, repository, or edition of a style guide.
  </p>
</article>
